#: ../../compatibility/compatibility-matrix.rst:157
#: ../../compatibility/compatibility-matrix.rst:203
msgid ""
"For AMD Instinct MI325X KVM SR-IOV users, do not use AMD GPU Driver "
"(amdgpu) 30.20.0."
