#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:-1
msgid "GPU, CPU, deep graph library, DGL, deep learning, framework compatibility"
msgstr "GPU、CPU、深度图库、DGL、深度学习、框架兼容性"

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:11
msgid "DGL compatibility"
msgstr "DGL兼容性"

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:13
msgid ""
"Deep Graph Library (`DGL <https://www.dgl.ai/>`__) is an easy-to-use, "
"high-performance, and scalable Python package for deep learning on "
"graphs. DGL is framework agnostic, meaning that if a deep graph model is "
"a component in an end-to-end application, the rest of the logic is "
"implemented using PyTorch."
msgstr ""
"Deep Graph Library（` DGL <https://www.dgl.ai/> ` __）是一个易于使用、高性能"
"且可扩展的 Python 包，专用于图上的深度学习。DGL 不依赖于特定框架，这意味着如"
"果一个深度图模型是端到端应用程序中的一个组件，其余逻辑将使用 PyTorch 实现。"

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:18
msgid ""
"DGL provides a high-performance graph object that can reside on either "
"CPUs or GPUs. It bundles structural data features for better control and "
"provides a variety of functions for computing with graph objects, "
"including efficient and customizable message passing primitives for Graph"
" Neural Networks."
msgstr ""
"DGL 提供了一个高性能的图对象，该对象既可在 CPU 上运行，也可在 GPU 上运行。它"
"集成了结构化数据特性以实现更精细的控制，并提供了多种用于对图对象进行计算的函"
"数，其中包括适用于图神经网络的高效且可定制的消息传递原语。"

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:24
